# Intentionally empty.
# pnpm 11 ignores env-var auth tokens placed in a committed project .npmrc, so npm
# auth lives in user-level ~/.npmrc — run `npm login`, which writes a session token
# there. Publishing needs a 2FA code: answer the prompt, or run
#   pnpm run release --otp=123456
# See RELEASING.md for the full flow.
